# Committed (what the tasks actually load):
#   *_terrain.usd        merged single-mesh course (build_course.py)
#   *_profile.json       height/clearance table (course_profile.py)
#   spiral_geometry.json spiral parameters (spiral_profile.py)
*.step
*.usd
!*_terrain.usd
*_bounds.json
*.log
hoops_config.json
